{"id": "17-1520-2-2", "zh": "小品词", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1521-2-6", "zh": "表示连接、选择、否定、补足等意义，而不指称实物的词，叫作小品词（nepātika）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1522-2-12", "zh": "其中，ca 用于并列连接、附带连接（anvācaya）、相互连接（itarītarayoga）、集合（samāhāra）、限定（avadhāraṇa）等意义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1523-2-9", "zh": "vā 用于选择、比喻、并列连接、有定的任选（vavatthitavibhāsā）等意义。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1524-2-10", "zh": "na、no、mā、a、alaṃ、halaṃ，这些用于否定义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1525-2-6", "zh": "alaṃ 也用于足够与装饰的意义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1526-2-6", "zh": "补足义分为两种：补足意义的，和补足词句的。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1527-2-32", "zh": "其中，atha、khalu、vata、vatha、atho、assu、yagghe、hi、carahi、naṃ、taṃ、vā、ca、tuva、vo、pana、have、kīva、ha、tato、yathā、sudaṃ、kho、ve、haṃ、enaṃ、seyyathidaṃ 等等，都是补足词句的词。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1528-2-12", "zh": "其中，atha 也用于提问、紧接其后、开启新话题等意义。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1529-2-9", "zh": "khalu 也用于否定、限定和众所周知的意义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1530-2-9", "zh": "vata 也用于确定、悲叹、怜悯和意愿的意义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1531-2-6", "zh": "atho 也用于随后再提及的意义。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1532-2-8", "zh": "hi 也用于原因和限定的意义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1533-2-8", "zh": "tu 也用于区别、原因、排除等意义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1534-2-5", "zh": "pana 也用于区别的意义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1535-2-8", "zh": "have、ve，这些也用于确定的意义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1536-2-6", "zh": "haṃ 也用于沮丧和慌乱的意义。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1537-2-7", "zh": "seyyathidaṃ 也用于“那是什么”的意义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1538-2-7", "zh": "补足意义的又分为两种：带格义的，和不带格义的。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1539-2-7", "zh": "atthi、sakkā、labbhā，这些用于第一格（主格）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1540-2-11", "zh": "āvuso、ambho、hambho、re、are、hare、je，这些用于呼唤。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1541-2-9", "zh": "divā、bhiyyo、namo，这些用于第一格和第二格。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1542-2-14", "zh": "sayaṃ、sāmaṃ、saṃ、sammā、kinti，这些用于第三格的意义；以 so、to、dhā 词缀结尾的词也是这样。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1542-15-22", "zh": "例如 suttaso、padaso、aniccato、dukkhato、ekadhā、dvidhā 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1543-2-14", "zh": "以 tave、tuṃ 词缀结尾的词用于第四格，例如 kātave、dātave、kātuṃ、kāretuṃ、dātuṃ、dāpetuṃ 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1544-2-14", "zh": "以 so、to 词缀结尾的词用于第五格的意义，例如 dīghaso、oraso、rājato vā、corato vā 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1545-2-8", "zh": "to 也用于第七格的意义；以 tra、tha 等词缀结尾的词也是这样。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1545-9-26", "zh": "例如 ekato、purato、pacchato、passato、piṭṭhito、pādato、sīsato、aggato、mūlato、yatra、yattha、yahiṃ、tatra、tattha、tahiṃ、tahaṃ 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1546-2-39", "zh": "samantā、sāmantā、parito、abhito、samantato、ekajjhaṃ、ekamantaṃ、heṭṭhā、upari、uddhaṃ、adho、tiriyaṃ、sammukhā、parammukhā、āvi、raho、tiro、uccaṃ、nīcaṃ、anto、antarā、ajjhattaṃ、bahiddhā、bāhirā、bāhiraṃ、bahi、oraṃ、pāraṃ、ārā、ārakā、pacchā、pure、huraṃ、pecca，这些用于第七格。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1547-2-32", "zh": "sampati、āyati、ajja、aparajju、parajja、suve、sve、parasuve、hiyyo、pare、sajju、sāyaṃ、pāto、kālaṃ、kallaṃ、divā、nattaṃ、niccaṃ、satataṃ、abhiṇhaṃ、abhikkhaṇaṃ、muhuṃ、muhuttaṃ、bhūtapubbaṃ、purā、yadā、tadā、kadā 等，用于表示时间的第七格。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1547-33-35", "zh": "以上是带格义的。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1548-2-9", "zh": "在不带格义的词中，appeva、appevanāma、nu，这些用于疑惑的意义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1549-2-10", "zh": "addhā、aññadatthu、taggha、jātu、kāmaṃ、sasakkaṃ，这些用于确定的意义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1550-2-5", "zh": "eva 用于限定。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1551-2-9", "zh": "kaccinu、kinnu、nanu、kathaṃ、kiṃsu、kiṃ，这些用于询问的意义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1552-2-7", "zh": "evaṃ、iti、itthaṃ，这些用于举例说明。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1553-2-6", "zh": "iti 也用于原因和句子结束的意义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1554-2-11", "zh": "yāva、tāva、yāvatā、tāvatā、kittāvatā、ettāvatā、kīva，这些用于限定范围的意义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1555-2-11", "zh": "evaṃ、sāhu、lahu、opāyikaṃ、patirūpaṃ、āma、sādhu，用于应允的意义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1556-2-24", "zh": "yathā、tathā、yatheva、tatheva、evaṃ、evameva、evamevaṃ、evampi、yathāpi、seyyathāpi、seyyathāpināma、viya、iva、yathariva、tathariva、yathānāma、tathānāma、yathāhi、tathāhi、yathāca、tathāca，这些用于比照相似的意义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1557-2-9", "zh": "yathā 也用于适宜、重复、不越出词义和举例说明的意义。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-1558-2-7", "zh": "evaṃ 也用于教导、提问等意义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1559-2-5", "zh": "kiñcāpi 用于让步承认的意义。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1560-2-8", "zh": "aho 也用于责备、赞叹和希求的意义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1561-2-9", "zh": "nāma 也用于责备、赞叹、名称和提问的意义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1562-2-7", "zh": "sādhu 也用于赞叹和请求的意义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1563-2-6", "zh": "iṅgha、handa，这些用于催促的意义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1564-2-7", "zh": "sādhu、suṭṭhu、evametaṃ，用于赞同。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1565-2-6", "zh": "kira 用于传闻和不可置信的意义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1566-2-8", "zh": "nūna 用于推测、回忆和思量的意义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1567-2-5", "zh": "kasmā 用于询问原因。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1568-2-8", "zh": "yasmā、tasmā、tathāhi、tena，这些用于判明原因的意义。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1569-2-8", "zh": "saha、saddhiṃ、samaṃ、amā，用于共同行动的意义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1570-2-6", "zh": "vinā、rite，用于分离的意义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1571-2-5", "zh": "nānā、puthu 用于多种多样的意义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1572-2-6", "zh": "puthu、visuṃ 也用于各自分开、不聚在一起的意义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1573-2-5", "zh": "duṭṭhu、ku 用于厌恶贬斥的意义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1574-2-4", "zh": "puna 用于不是第一次（再次）的意义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1575-2-5", "zh": "kathañci 也用于艰难的意义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1576-2-6", "zh": "dhā、kkhattuṃ、sakiṃ 用于数目区分。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1577-2-5", "zh": "īsakaṃ 用于少许的意义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1578-2-4", "zh": "saṇikaṃ 用于缓慢的意义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1579-2-10", "zh": "khippaṃ、araṃ、lahu、āsuṃ、tuṇṇaṃ、aciraṃ 用于迅速的意义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1580-2-5", "zh": "ciraṃ、cirassaṃ 用于长时间的意义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1581-2-5", "zh": "ce、yadi 用于有所疑虑的假设情形。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-1582-2-4", "zh": "dhuvaṃ 用于稳固和限定的意义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1583-2-4", "zh": "hā 用于沮丧。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1584-2-4", "zh": "tuṇhī 用于不说话。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1585-2-4", "zh": "sacchi 用于亲眼现见。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1586-2-6", "zh": "musā、micchā、alikaṃ 用于不真实的意义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1587-2-5", "zh": "suvatthi 用于祝愿的意义，等等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1588-2-8", "zh": "以 tuna、tvāna、tvā 词缀结尾的词，用于表示先行动作的意义。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-1589-2-25", "zh": "例如：passituna、passiya、passitvāna、passitvā、disvā、disvāna、dassetvā、dātuna、datvāna、datvā、upādāya、dāpetvā、viññāpetvā、viceyya、vineyya、nihacca、samecca、apecca、upecca、ārabbha、āgamma 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1590-2-10", "zh": "这样，凡是不属于名词、动词、前缀，而具有不变词特征的，都应当知道是小品词。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1591-2-3", "zh": "又如所说：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1592-2-10", "zh": "“因为它不属于前三类词，所以落在它们之间；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-1593-2-12", "zh": "凡具有不变特征的，就称为小品词。”", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1594-2-4", "zh": "小品词章结束。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1595-2-6", "zh": "阳性和阴性，另外还有中性；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1596-2-8", "zh": "三性通用和无性，名词共分为五类。", "confidence": 75}
